{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#card-zh","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的网络代理插件，在通用设置页加入网络代理控制项，并由服务端接管 undici 全局 Dispatcher。用户可以选择跟随系统代理、填写 HTTP 或 HTTPS 手动代理地址，或切换为直连；设置变更通过 live settings 即时应用。Windows 系统模式读取 Internet Settings 中的代理服务器和绕过列表，其他平台读取 HTTP(S)_PROXY 环境变量。适合需要在 DSH 中切换网络出口的用户；不需要 API key 或额外账号，手动模式需提供代理 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:133-176","client.js:192-261","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#card-en","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-network-proxy adds a proxy control to DSH settings and manages the global undici Dispatcher. Choose the system proxy, enter an HTTP(S) URL, or connect directly; changes apply live. Windows reads Internet Settings; other platforms use inherited HTTP(S)_PROXY variables. No key or account needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:133-176","client.js:192-261","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
