{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#feature-1","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 的功能「代理模式切换」：在 DSH 通用设置页选择跟随系统、手动代理或直连，提交后服务端通过 live settings 更新全局 Dispatcher 和代理环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:192-229","index.js:150-176"]}
{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#feature-2","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 的功能「手动代理地址」：在手动模式输入 HTTP 或 HTTPS URL 并应用；服务端校验 URL 格式和协议后创建 ProxyAgent。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:212-228","index.js:47-58","index.js:142-148"]}
{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#feature-3","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 的功能「系统代理读取」：切换到 system 模式后，Windows 读取 Internet Settings 注册表；其他平台使用进程启动时继承的 HTTP(S)_PROXY 变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:104-139"]}
{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#feature-4","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 的功能「Windows 代理规则解析」：解析 ProxyServer 中按 http 与 https 区分的地址或单一地址，并把 ProxyOverride 转为 NO_PROXY 绕过列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:90-101","index.js:123-130"]}
{"unit_id":"kriskite__dsh-network-proxy#caveat-1","repo":"kriskite/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"b191f365db02e85e82df207e5b64f27edb9fc628","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-network-proxy 使用前须知：Windows 系统代理的 PAC 自动配置脚本不受支持；检测到 AutoConfigURL 时会提示改用手动代理。（见 index.js:119-121）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:119-121"]}
